 "hook": "My friend Brock was in a surfing accident that left him paralyzed from",
 "transcript_start": "My friend Brock was in a surfing accident that left him paralyzed from the waist down. And I was lucky enough to share a conversation with him today where something he said really stuck with me. What he said was, dude, all I can do is take it day by day. And if I can't take it by day, I can take it by the hour. If I can't take it by the hour, I can take it by the minute. And if I can't take it by the minute, well dude, I can take it by the second",
